<view class="container">
  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-title">H5 访问地址（baseURL）</view>
    <input
      class="input"
      value="{{baseUrl}}"
      placeholder="如 http://localhost:5173 或 https://microapp.zndkfx.com"
      bindinput="onBaseUrlInput"
    />
    <view class="preset-row">
      <view class="preset-tag" bindtap="useLocal">本地(5173)</view>
      <view class="preset-tag" bindtap="useProd">生产域名</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-title">SSO 授权码（authcode，选填）</view>
    <input
      class="input"
      value="{{authcode}}"
      placeholder="填写后访问页面会自动携带 ?authcode="
      bindinput="onAuthcodeInput"
    />
    <view class="hint">留空则走 H5 内部普通登录；填写则模拟畅行温州免登。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-title">页面入口</view>
    <view class="link-list">
      <view
        class="link-item"
        wx:for="{{links}}"
        wx:key="path"
        data-path="{{item.path}}"
        bindtap="openPage"
      >
        <view class="link-name">{{item.name}}</view>
        <view class="link-path">{{item.path}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="tip">
    提示：微信开发者工具 → 详情 → 本地设置，勾选“不校验合法域名、web-view、TLS 版本以及 HTTPS 证书”，localhost 才能在 web-view 中加载。
  </view>
</view>
